extends /specs/products/physio/page-structure/structure/templates/structure/layout-tmpl.jade
block content
    .source_info
        p <strong>Card</strong> component can be used on different other components and widgets (eg. slider, newsletter).
    section.source_section
        include /specs/page-structure/helpers/print-json-mixin.jade
        include /specs/page-structure/helpers/print-js-code-mixin.jade
        h2 Usage
        h3 Include template
        +printJsCode('include /specs/ux3/components/card/templates/cards/cards-tmpl.jade')
        h3 Data
        markdown
            p The following data structure must exist to be able to use Card template.
        +printJson({
            "config": {
                "className": [
                "card"
                ]
            },
            "data": {
            "content": "text"
            }
        })
        markdown
            p You can add custom classes to the container element by passing an array of class names in `"addClassNames": ["...", "..."]`.
    | #{''}
    section.source_section
        h2 Physio cards Examples
        h3!= data.items[1].title
        +printJson({
            "card": {
                "config": {
                "classes": ""
            },
            "header": "Drug & Medical Innovation",
            "body": "<a href=\"#\"> <img class=\"featuredCard__cover\" src=\"/specs/products/hope/components/card/images/hope-fetaured-card-cover.png\" alt=\"\"> <h3 class=\"featuredCard__title\">House Seeks Pause In Cost-Sharing Reduction Litigation (Updated)</h3> </a> <div class=\"featuredCard__details\"> <span class=\"featuredCard__date\">November 22, 2016</span><span class=\"featuredCard__authors\">Timothy Jost</span> </div>",
            "tale": {
                "text": "More",
                "link": "#"
                }
            }
        })
        .source_example
            .container
                .row
                    .col-sm-4
                        | !{data.items[1].body}
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `journal` class to to one of its parents element.
        h3!= data.items[2].title
        +printJson({
            "card": {
                "config": {
                "classes": ""
                },
                "header": "Drug & Medical Innovation",
                "body": "<a href=\"#\"> <img class=\"featuredCard__cover\" src=\"/specs/products/hope/components/card/images/hope-fetaured-card-cover.png\" alt=\"\"> <h3 class=\"featuredCard__title\">House Seeks Pause In Cost-Sharing Reduction Litigation (Updated)</h3> </a> <div class=\"featuredCard__details\"> <span class=\"featuredCard__date\">November 22, 2016</span><span class=\"featuredCard__authors\">Timothy Jost</span> </div>",
                    "tale": {
                        "text": "More",
                        "link": "#"
                    }
            }
        })
        .source_example
            .container
                .row
                    .journal.col-sm-4
                        | !{data.items[2].body}
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `blog` class to to one of its parents element.
        h3!= data.items[3].title
        +printJson({
            "card": {
                "config": {
                "classes": ""
                },
                    "header": "Drug & Medical Innovation",
                    "body": "<a href=\"#\"> <img class=\"featuredCard__cover\" src=\"/specs/products/hope/components/card/images/hope-fetaured-card-cover.png\" alt=\"\"> <h3 class=\"featuredCard__title\">House Seeks Pause In Cost-Sharing Reduction Litigation (Updated)</h3> </a> <div class=\"featuredCard__details\"> <span class=\"featuredCard__date\">November 22, 2016</span><span class=\"featuredCard__authors\">Timothy Jost</span> </div>",
                    "tale": {
                        "text": "More",
                        "link": "#"
                }
            }
        })
        .source_example
            .container
                .row
                    .blog.col-sm-4
                        | !{data.items[3].body}
    | #{''}
